&lt;h1&gt;ABOUT HAPPY MONEY&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Happy Money is a consumer finance company that empowers people to achieve their goals through simple, transparent loans funded by trusted financial institutions. Through its proprietary lending platform, Hive, Happy Money delivers a fully digital experience that simplifies borrowing for consumers and helps credit unions, banks and asset managers diversify balance sheets and scale with confidence. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Happy Money’s end-to-end loan origination and participation programs provide partners with turnkey access to high-performing assets, underpinned by disciplined credit expertise and robust risk management. Together with its lending partners, Happy Money has originated more than $7 billion in loans to help nearly 350,000 people take greater control of their financial futures. Learn more at happymoney.com. View our &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1PlDoDVlGPfcmkNK5meAmsnFV6DVuiypG/view?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;Employee Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt; here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Happy Money is a 100% fully distributed company. Remote work doesn’t mean less work, we work full-time jobs and show up to them fully every day. To learn more about our values and the way we work, review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://drive.google.com/file/d/1wtjH-1Y9UDgAGX_5AjcSvF3y08zf3t1M/view&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Happy Money Way Overview!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Happy Money is hiring a Creative Marketing Manager to own creative and content across every channel we market in. The role is equal parts strategist and maker. You&#39;ll set creative direction, then do the hands-on writing, designing, shooting and editing to get it live. You&#39;ll be our lead designer across happymoney.com, paid social, paid search, lifecycle email, direct mail and organic social, and the on-camera face of Happy Money in short-form video for Instagram Reels, TikTok and YouTube Shorts. Your biggest focus will be telling our customers&#39; stories: how people paid off debt and made progress toward their goals. You&#39;ll join as Happy Money rolls out a refreshed visual identity and help set how it shows up everywhere. You&#39;ll also own how that creative performs, from the first line of a page or the first second of a video to the click, and use the results to decide what to make next. You care about how a brand looks and feels, and when an ad works, you want to know why.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own creative strategy and execution across happymoney.com, paid social, paid search, lifecycle email, direct mail and organic social, with a documented content strategy, content calendar and roadmap tied to acquisition and brand goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own creative performance across the funnel, from hook to message to call to action: define success metrics and a testing plan before each launch, decide what to scale, cut or iterate on, and bring a new direction when a format plateaus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design creative for every channel as Happy Money&#39;s primary in-house designer, including paid ads, direct mail pieces, email hero images and templates, landing pages and organic social&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set Happy Money&#39;s creative standard as our new visual identity rolls out, working within brand guidelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create content and creative for happymoney.com, including landing pages, articles, guides and product pages, and partner with SEO/AEO so it performs in search and AI answers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Happy Money&#39;s organic social presence on Instagram, Facebook, TikTok and YouTube, and engage with followers in partnership with Customer Support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Appear on camera as the face of Happy Money&#39;s social channels, in content like a 30-second explainer video on APR versus interest rate&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, script, shoot and edit short-form video for Reels, TikTok and YouTube Shorts, and adapt paid creative so it feels native to organic and web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tell customer impact stories through photo and video, interviews and user-generated content, and help share employee stories on our social channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage a creator and influencer program, from finding and contracting partners to writing briefs and scripts and tracking results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a library of photos, video, graphics and licensed stock imagery, organized so the team can quickly find approved assets for campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and set up the tools, partners and AI-assisted workflows the creative function needs, including video editing and UGC platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clear briefs and run feedback loops with agencies, freelancers and creators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Communications on email, long-form copy and scripts so messaging stays consistent across channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring compliance in early, move work through legal, compliance and bank partner review, and set up a faster path for time-sensitive organic posts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance creative priorities across acquisition, lifecycle, brand and product when requests compete&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track performance through dashboards and a weekly review covering impressions, engagement, site traffic and applications, and share results and what customers are saying with marketing leadership, product and lifecycle teams&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT SUCCESS LOOKS LIKE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative improves acquisition efficiency and engagement, measured by CPA, CTR, conversion rate, engagement rate and applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Day-to-day design for paid, email, direct mail, web and social is produced in-house&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Happy Money’s web pages carry fresh, on-brand content and creative that supports conversion and search visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A steady testing cadence across channels, with learnings documented and winning concepts turned into repeatable formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organic social audiences and engagement grow quarter over quarter, with customer impact stories and on-camera explainers as a regular part of the mix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A creator and influencer program is running, with partners in place and results tracked against clear goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The team works from an organized library of approved assets, and campaigns launch faster because of it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;ABOUT YOU&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years in graphic design, creative or content marketing, in-house or at an agency, with experience owning both strategy and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A portfolio with a mix of short-form and long-form work, including paid ads, email, direct mail or print, web content and video you shot, edited or appeared in, that tells a clear story visually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong graphic design foundation, through formal training or hands-on experience, including layout, typography, color and accessibility standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in Figma and Adobe Creative Suite, including Photoshop and Premiere Pro, plus a mobile editing tool like CapCut&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable on camera and excited to be the face of Happy Money&#39;s social channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to turn complex financial topics like APRs, credit scores and debt payoff into clear content&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building content strategies and calendars and creating content for websites, with a working understanding of SEO and conversion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using performance data to guide creative decisions and changing course when the numbers call for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience preparing print-ready files and working with print and mail vendors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of growing organic social channels, with deep knowledge of social-first storytelling and platform trends on Instagram and TikTok&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and self-directed, comfortable running a test-and-learn channel without direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;BONUS POINTS FOR&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in lending, banking or another regulated industry; Fair Lending awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copywriting and storytelling experience, including email, long-form web copy and video scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or managing creator or influencer partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Email template development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motion design skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with HubSpot, including HubSpot CMS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;BENEFITS &amp;amp; PERKS&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous medical, dental, and vision insurance options&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligible for Annual Bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k Plan with a matching contribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous PTO including sick leave, vacation, volunteer, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12 Weeks Paid Parental Leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid short &amp;amp; long term disability and life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly tech stipend to help cover expenses for remote work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Happy Money is a 100% fully distributed workforce&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$110,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$130,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
